  titleAccent: 'a guided tour',
  hook: 'In the beginning. The world is made in seven days, unmade in forty, and remade around a promise to one wandering family. Genesis is the seed bed of half of Western literature.',
  themesBlurb: 'Creation, the fall, covenant, and the long argument between God and the family he chose.',
